{title: Naina Lade}
{artist: Javed Ali Dabang 3}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G]Dil ki baatein [Em]kahi hain,        [G]Usne palkein jhuka ke
Ik nazar usne [Em]dekha,        [G]Humko jo muskura ke
Hum jahan the wa [A]hin par,        Khade reh [G]gaye
Unse naina [Em]lade ke lade reh [Am]gaye [D],        [G]Naina lade ke lade reh gaye
[Em]Naina lade ke lade reh gaye,        [Am]Naina lade ke la [F]de reh gaye
[D]Naina lade ke lade reh gaye,        [G]Naina lade ke lade reh gaye
[Em]Naina lade ke lade reh gaye,        [Am]Naina lade ke la [F]de reh gaye
[D]Naina lade ke lade reh gaye,        [G]Jannat mein bhi shayad na [F]ho
Koyi [C]hoor uss [G]hasin ki tarah,        [G]Dekha nahi chehre pe [F]humne
Kahin [C]noor uss [G]hasin ki tarah,        Ishq [Bm]ki woh ibte [G]da hai
Husn [Bm]ki woh inte [Em]ha hai,        Ba- [F]khuda ba- [G]khuda
Kya batau achanak kya hu [Bm]a hai [Em]muze,        Mus [Bm]kura ke jo u [G]sne
jab se [Bm]dekha mu [G]jhe,        Teer nazro ke [A]dil mein gade reh [G]gaye
Unse naina lade [Em]ke,        [Am]lade reh gaye [G]
Naina lade ke lade reh gaye,        Naina [Em]lade ke lade reh gaye
[Am]Naina lade ke [F]lade,        Naina lade, [D]naina lade ke reh gaye
[G]Naina lade ke lade reh gaye,        Naina [Em]lade ke lade reh gaye
Naina [Am]lade ke [F]lade reh gaye,        [D]Naina lade ke lade [G]reh gaye
Chashme karam kee [F]jiye,        Sar [C]kaar ha [G]maari taraf
Dekho idhar bhi ek [F]baar,        Ae [C]yaar ha [G]maari taraf
Hai asar yeh ik nazar ka,        Rog [Bm]humne umra bhar [G]ka
Le [F]liya, le [G]liya,        Dil ki baatein yeh sab
Unse jaakar kahein,        Har ghadi, har samay
Uske [Bm]sang hum ra [G]hein,        Khawaab aankhon mein [A]kitne
Jade reh ga [G]ye,        Unse naina lade [Em]ke
[Am]lade reh gaye [G],        Naina lade ke lade reh gaye
[Em]Naina lade ke lade reh gaye,        [Am]Naina lade ke [F]lade reh gaye
[D]Naina lade,ke lade reh gaye,        [G]Naina lade ke lade reh gaye
[Em]Naina lade ke lade reh gaye,        [Am]Naina lade ke [F]lade reh gaye
[D]Naina lade ke [G]lade reh gaye
